WEBVTT

00:00.120 --> 00:01.000
It is late.

00:01.000 --> 00:02.470
You are still scrolling.

00:15.120 --> 00:17.110
For a second, you believe it.

00:29.053 --> 00:31.253
Footnote listens to what you watch.

00:31.253 --> 00:35.283
When a claim can be checked, it
checks it, and shows you the sources.

00:37.820 --> 00:39.240
Here is how it works.

00:39.240 --> 00:44.640
Your phone sends the sound and the
screen to our server, on a Hostinger VPS.

00:44.640 --> 00:46.990
There, the sound becomes sentences.

00:48.087 --> 00:49.787
Then, the gate.

00:49.787 --> 00:53.167
Jev, a decision model on
the Hostinger AI Router,

00:53.167 --> 00:55.947
reads every sentence and every frame.

00:55.947 --> 00:58.227
It is fast, and very cheap to run.

00:58.227 --> 01:00.227
It asks three questions.

01:00.227 --> 01:01.947
Is it about public affairs?

01:01.947 --> 01:04.167
Is it a claim that sources can check?

01:04.167 --> 01:05.727
Does the speaker mean it?

01:05.727 --> 01:09.827
Most of what you watch stops
here, and costs almost nothing.

01:09.827 --> 01:11.697
Only a real claim goes on.

01:12.753 --> 01:14.293
Now, the check.

01:14.293 --> 01:19.273
Our agent, on the same VPS, searches
the web and reads the sources.

01:19.273 --> 01:23.393
It uses a large model,
through the Hostinger AI Router.

01:23.393 --> 01:26.393
Two independent sources
contradict the claim.

01:26.393 --> 01:29.893
As soon as the check is done,
the asterisk lights up.

01:29.893 --> 01:32.283
By then, you may be on the next video.

01:33.587 --> 01:35.547
All of it runs on Hostinger.

01:35.547 --> 01:38.327
One VPS, for the server and the agent.

01:38.327 --> 01:40.547
The AI Router, for every model.

01:40.547 --> 01:42.867
Jev, the cheap model, reads everything.

01:42.867 --> 01:46.167
The large model starts only
for the few claims that pass.

01:46.167 --> 01:48.637
Built, and tested, on Hostinger.

01:49.853 --> 01:51.793
It does not tell you what to think.

01:51.793 --> 01:52.863
You decide.

01:54.053 --> 01:54.053
Footnote.

01:54.053 --> 01:56.643
Footnotes where it matters.
